  "description": "Joohee Kang is a third-year surgical resident who became a doctor. After losing her parents and brother in an accident 14 years ago, she decided to follow in her father's footsteps as a surgeon.\n\nForced to go to the doctor by her new mother, who raised her in place of her parents, there she met Han Jae-Joon, the handsome man who saved her from almost falling twice in the hotel.\n\n\"I met him again in the hospital?! He's even my professor?!\"  \nWill Joo-hee be able to survive her surgical career without revealing her identity to him?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61931976), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A7%91%EC%B0%A9%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%EC%9C%A0/3647)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/157941)",
